                "comment": "Hasan is a very straight forward lecturer, but also likes to crack jokes sometimes. His exams are based purely off of readings and lecture so if you complete those, you're fine. His exams were composed completely of \"select the incorrect answer...\" questions which we all told him we hated, but he did it anyways. Material is interesting!",
